WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.875
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna explained

2
00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:35.500
that one who remembers
 Him at the time of death

3
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.166
reaches His shelter.

4
00:00:38.166 --> 00:00:41.333
Now in this verse, He's describing a general rule

5
00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:44.000
for the entire world that applies to every being

6
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.500
in the moments

7
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.833
of death.

8
00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:53.875
Lord Krishna

9
00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:54.625
explains

10
00:00:54.625 --> 00:00:55.166
an important

11
00:00:55.166 --> 00:00:58.125
principle of this world in this verse –

12
00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:01.791
'Whatever a human remembers
 in the final moment,

13
00:01:01.791 --> 00:01:04.125
that very thing they obtain.'

14
00:01:04.125 --> 00:01:05.750
Lord Krishna says

15
00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.583
that thoughts at the time of death

16
00:01:07.583 --> 00:01:10.791
determine our next birth.

17
00:01:10.791 --> 00:01:14.250
He uses the word 'bhāva' here,

18
00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:15.416
which shows

19
00:01:15.416 --> 00:01:16.500
that at life's end,

20
00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.833
whatever feelings, desires,

21
00:01:19.833 --> 00:01:21.458
or attachments

22
00:01:21.458 --> 00:01:25.041
are in our consciousness, those very
 things give shape to our coming life.

23
00:01:25.041 --> 00:01:26.625
He also explains

24
00:01:26.625 --> 00:01:28.083
that if someone remembers Him 

25
00:01:28.083 --> 00:01:29.708
at the time of death, then they obtain

26
00:01:29.708 --> 00:01:32.791
His divine form.

27
00:01:32.791 --> 00:01:35.666
Therefore, remaining engaged in Lord Krishna's 

28
00:01:35.666 --> 00:01:38.916
service throughout life is extremely important.

29
00:01:43.791 --> 00:01:44.791
The mind is

30
00:01:44.791 --> 00:01:47.708
such a wonderful mirror

31
00:01:47.708 --> 00:01:49.125
in which you can see your

32
00:01:49.125 --> 00:01:53.458
future's reflection!

33
00:01:53.458 --> 00:01:55.875
As the contemplation,

34
00:01:55.875 --> 00:01:58.666
so the life!

35
00:01:58.666 --> 00:01:59.291
In life,

36
00:01:59.291 --> 00:02:02.333
whatever thoughts you remain immersed in,

37
00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:05.375
whatever your thinking is,

38
00:02:05.375 --> 00:02:11.291
that very thing becomes your reality.

39
00:02:11.291 --> 00:02:13.125
Whatever you remember in death's moment,

40
00:02:13.125 --> 00:02:16.875
that very remembrance,

41
00:02:16.875 --> 00:02:22.333
that very thought will become
 seeds of your coming life.

42
00:02:22.333 --> 00:02:24.291
Think –

43
00:02:24.291 --> 00:02:28.083
just as a farmer who sows seed of some fruit

44
00:02:28.083 --> 00:02:30.875
obtains that very fruit, similarly

45
00:02:30.875 --> 00:02:32.625
whatever thoughts

46
00:02:32.625 --> 00:02:35.333
you water in your consciousness,

47
00:02:35.333 --> 00:02:40.791
your life becomes according to those.

48
00:02:40.791 --> 00:02:44.000
If your mind keeps diving in
 the river of 

49
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:48.958
momentary pleasure and negative thoughts,

50
00:02:48.958 --> 00:02:51.500
then these thoughts' water stream

51
00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:54.166
keeps flowing with you

52
00:02:54.166 --> 00:02:57.750
until your final journey.

53
00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:59.333
Therefore,

54
00:02:59.333 --> 00:03:03.500
selection of excellent thoughts
 is extremely necessary,

55
00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:06.708
through which goodness always happens.

56
00:03:06.708 --> 00:03:08.666
It's said,

57
00:03:08.666 --> 00:03:10.500
as the vision,

58
00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:13.666
so the perspective.

59
00:03:13.666 --> 00:03:16.791
Your faith and belief aren't just means

60
00:03:16.791 --> 00:03:18.708
of seeing the world from your vision,

61
00:03:18.708 --> 00:03:21.208
rather slowly these also transform

62
00:03:21.208 --> 00:03:26.208
your actual world according

63
00:03:26.208 --> 00:03:30.916
to themselves.

64
00:03:30.916 --> 00:03:33.625
For example, if you remain immersed daily

65
00:03:33.625 --> 00:03:34.500
only in worry

66
00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:37.375
of wealth and property,

67
00:03:37.375 --> 00:03:42.291
then in the final moment too 
your mind wanders there.

68
00:03:42.291 --> 00:03:47.916
But if you spend some time of
 your day in service,

69
00:03:47.916 --> 00:03:51.625
meditation, or My remembrance,

70
00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:55.250
then these samskāras take deep root

71
00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.666
in your inner mind.

72
00:03:57.666 --> 00:04:02.666
Go, become the vigilant gatekeeper
 of your heart.

73
00:04:02.666 --> 00:04:06.458
Whatever thoughts will take
 you toward eternal truth,

74
00:04:06.458 --> 00:04:09.750
give entry only to those.

75
00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:15.333
Through this practice, you'll move
 toward that supreme abode

76
00:04:15.333 --> 00:04:17.541
where I always

77
00:04:17.541 --> 00:04:20.500
wait for you.

78
00:04:25.125 --> 00:04:27.708
Have you ever thought

79
00:04:27.708 --> 00:04:30.750
how family's small-small quarrels

80
00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:31.708
can affect

81
00:04:31.708 --> 00:04:35.000
your pleasant future?

82
00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.791
In family life, often

83
00:04:37.791 --> 00:04:39.208
we get entangled

84
00:04:39.208 --> 00:04:43.083
in the web of disputes and animosity.

85
00:04:43.083 --> 00:04:44.833
But keep in mind,

86
00:04:44.833 --> 00:04:48.250
these feelings not only fix your present

87
00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:50.166
but also your state

88
00:04:50.166 --> 00:04:53.333
after death.

89
00:04:53.333 --> 00:04:56.500
Just as one stone thrown in a pond

90
00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:59.250
creates many waves,

91
00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:00.416
similarly

92
00:05:00.416 --> 00:05:04.125
even a small dispute in family relationships

93
00:05:04.125 --> 00:05:05.250
can generate

94
00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:09.583
many waves of commotion in your mind.

95
00:05:09.583 --> 00:05:12.416
Look – in a family, brothers and sisters

96
00:05:12.416 --> 00:05:13.833
for mutual property

97
00:05:13.833 --> 00:05:16.625
remain filled with bitterness for years.

98
00:05:16.625 --> 00:05:19.916
This bitterness, this animosity ultimately

99
00:05:19.916 --> 00:05:23.666
dominates their thoughts so much that

100
00:05:23.666 --> 00:05:27.500
even at their life journey's final stop,

101
00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:30.500
they remain surrounded by these very thoughts.

102
00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:34.166
True wealth isn't just home and property,

103
00:05:34.166 --> 00:05:36.166
rather it's preparation

104
00:05:36.166 --> 00:05:39.875
for where you'll go after leaving the body.

105
00:05:39.875 --> 00:05:43.125
The goal of reaching the next world

106
00:05:43.125 --> 00:05:49.291
is fixed by your feelings and
 resolves in this world.

107
00:05:49.291 --> 00:05:52.208
Resolve quarrels with love,

108
00:05:52.208 --> 00:05:53.500
abandon animosity,

109
00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:57.958
and fill your heart with
 compassion and devotion.

110
00:05:57.958 --> 00:06:00.708
When you give importance to peace

111
00:06:00.708 --> 00:06:04.166
and spiritual advancement in your family,

112
00:06:04.166 --> 00:06:07.416
then you walk on that divine light's path

113
00:06:07.416 --> 00:06:12.083
which will bring you near Me.

114
00:06:12.083 --> 00:06:15.166
By focusing on positive thoughts and high

115
00:06:15.166 --> 00:06:19.041
life values,

116
00:06:19.041 --> 00:06:22.416
you can cross this worldly world's bondages

117
00:06:22.416 --> 00:06:25.291
with simplicity.

118
00:06:30.041 --> 00:06:31.958
Think and see –

119
00:06:31.958 --> 00:06:36.291
just as a skilled sculptor, absorbed in their art,

120
00:06:36.291 --> 00:06:40.500
gives stone the form of deity,

121
00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.666
similarly your good karmas also

122
00:06:43.666 --> 00:06:48.625
give beautiful shape to your contemplation.

123
00:06:48.625 --> 00:06:50.708
In your work life,

124
00:06:50.708 --> 00:06:52.875
it's very important

125
00:06:52.875 --> 00:06:58.041
what kind of thoughts remain in your mind.

126
00:06:58.041 --> 00:07:00.666
At the workplace, whatever thoughts,

127
00:07:00.666 --> 00:07:02.083
what kind of thinking

128
00:07:02.083 --> 00:07:04.041
you focus on,

129
00:07:04.041 --> 00:07:05.750
that affects not only your job

130
00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:07.083
or business but also

131
00:07:07.083 --> 00:07:12.083
your personal life outside this field.

132
00:07:12.083 --> 00:07:13.500
Think –

133
00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:14.750
a businessperson

134
00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.166
who day and night remains lost

135
00:07:16.166 --> 00:07:18.833
only in profit-loss figures,

136
00:07:18.833 --> 00:07:20.333
will they be able

137
00:07:20.333 --> 00:07:24.000
to be free from these worries in the final moment?

138
00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.541
If you remain immersed

139
00:07:25.541 --> 00:07:28.458
in greed for position, prestige, or more wealth,

140
00:07:28.458 --> 00:07:29.208
then these attachments

141
00:07:29.208 --> 00:07:33.125
can chase you until the moment of death.

142
00:07:33.125 --> 00:07:35.041
Just as rain drops

143
00:07:35.041 --> 00:07:36.875
grow plants

144
00:07:36.875 --> 00:07:38.458
only where there are seeds,

145
00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:42.625
similarly your thoughts flourish
 only where your faith is.

146
00:07:42.625 --> 00:07:45.000
Where there are seeds of positive thoughts,

147
00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:47.541
rain your concentration there.

148
00:07:47.541 --> 00:07:50.750
Where there will be seeds of negativity,

149
00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:53.458
they'll be destroyed themselves

150
00:07:53.458 --> 00:07:55.916
by the drought

151
00:07:55.916 --> 00:07:58.583
of no rain.

152
00:07:58.583 --> 00:08:02.541
This same rule applies in the office too:

153
00:08:02.541 --> 00:08:04.291
if you always

154
00:08:04.291 --> 00:08:07.541
keep your mind submerged in stress,

155
00:08:07.541 --> 00:08:11.666
competition, or selfishness, then these very
 things will become your nature.

156
00:08:11.666 --> 00:08:12.958
Make your work

157
00:08:12.958 --> 00:08:15.958
a means of surrender to Me.

158
00:08:15.958 --> 00:08:18.750
Make honesty, team spirit,

159
00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:22.708
and everyone's development your goal.

160
00:08:22.708 --> 00:08:24.833
Through this selfless karma yoga,

161
00:08:24.833 --> 00:08:28.750
you'll obtain that state, where your professional

162
00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:29.875
life also

163
00:08:29.875 --> 00:08:35.000
becomes part of your spiritual practice.
